Package: curl-polycall
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 curl,
 coreutils
Description: curl-based client of Polycall peer nodes (polycall-peer/1)
 curl-polycall talks to Polycall peer nodes -- `polycall peer serve`, the C
 library's polycall_peer_* nodes, or any conforming implementation -- over
 HTTP/1.1 + JSON with curl: health, registry, register, acknowledged send
 and inbox receive, with the polycall CLI's exit-code contract.
